| riscos-mesa test, linked "mixed": sdlgltest: SDL with OpenGL, a 640x480 window.
| UnixLib is linked into the program; OpenGL, EGL, SDL and OpenAL come from
| !MesaLibs (this directory's copy, if none is booted) through !SharedLibs.
Set MesaMixed$Dir <Obey$Dir>
RMEnsure SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 Error This test needs SharedUnixLibrary 1.16 or later
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then IfThere Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot Then Run Boot:Resources.!SharedLibs.!Boot
If "<SharedLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Error This test needs !SharedLibs (with ld-riscos/so/2) in !Boot.Resources
Unset MesaMixed$SO2
IfThere SharedLibs:lib.ld-riscos-eabihf/so Then Set MesaMixed$SO2 1
If "<MesaMixed$SO2>" = "" Then Error The !SharedLibs booted has no ld-riscos/so/2: a newer one is needed (GCCSDK 8 or later, as in Iris)
If "<MesaLibs$Dir>" = "" Then Run <MesaMixed$Dir>.!MesaLibs.!Boot
| SOManager finds the program's libraries through <program>$LD$Env
Set sdlgltest$LD$Env "LD_LIBRARY_PATH=/MesaLibs:"
Dir <MesaMixed$Dir>
Run sdlgltest 640 480
